# Plot is a special action only in your own main phase (CR 702.170a, 116.2k): on Bot2's turn two, with Bot2's Bolt on the stack
# and {R}{R} in Bot1's pool, plotting is refused. On Bot1's own turn three the same mana plots it (the positive control).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Slickshot Show-Off
Mountain x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Slickshot Show-Off.Activate(Ability: Plot)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Slickshot Show-Off.Activate(Ability: Plot)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile = Slickshot Show-Off
